### Credential profiles (EUD-215) ###
# CREDENTIAL_PROFILES_PATH is always overridden to an external mounted path
# (Docker volume locally, EFS in STG) - this classpath location is never
# actually read in any environment we run. Keep it out of git so nobody
# mistakes it for the real deployment artifact (that's platform-dev's
# dev-tools/schemas/, synced via eudistack-platform-iac's efs-files-sync).
src/main/resources/credentials/profiles/*.json

### Keystores (EUD-228, quality-report.md B1) ###
# A PKCS#12 keystore under src/main/resources/ is packaged into the production jar
# (Dockerfile copies build/libs/*.jar). Never commit one that holds a private key —
# src/main/resources/keystore/oj-keystore.p12 is the sole exception below because it
# holds only public trustedCertEntry material (the DSS reference OJ keystore, AD-12).
# Real production signing secrets are injected at deploy time (TRUST_REGISTRY_SIGNING_*),
# never committed. Test fixtures under src/test/resources/ are throwaway keys explicitly
# marked "DO NOT USE IN PRODUCTION" and are safe to track.
*.p12
!src/main/resources/keystore/oj-keystore.p12
!src/test/resources/**/*.p12
